  :adr/body "## What this session did

Measured the cloud-itonami accounting plane against MoneyForward, then built
what was missing, then found that the measuring was the least reliable part.

### Landed on default branches

| repo | before | after | note |
|---|---|---|---|
| cloud-itonami-isco-4311 | 129/429 | 219/904 | 元帳/仕訳帳, 検索要件, 消費税申告 |
| cloud-itonami-isco-4313 | 115/599 | 239/1287 | 年末調整, 社会保険 |
| keihi | 103/430 | 137/570 | handoff route, non-JP |
| tehai | 94/348 | 138/672 | derives 消費税額等 |
| shiharai-actor | 146/899 | 188/1280 | non-JP, E6 escalation |
| taxlaw | 32/293 | 79/599 | [:eu] [:us], per-facet coverage, world denominator |
| shohyo | 24/99 | 104/536 | IFRS module, 連結会計 |
| shokyaku (new) | -- | 33/517 | 減価償却, registered in west |
| psa | 41/96 | 62/159 | tax-category subtotals |
| technology / iso3166 / cofog / unspsc / industry / occupation | JVM-only | portable | compiled-in registries |
| kgraph / scene-author / rdf-canon / release / package-registry-ipfs / grammar / kotoba-actors / isic / net-isekai-gen / ongakuka | JVM-only | portable | |
